    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc1 Street Drive Rush</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the streets in a high-speed, urban driving experience packed with challenge and variety.</strong><br>In <i>Street Drive Rush</i>, you\u2019ll take on the city in three distinct driving modes: <i>Time Trial, Parkour,</i> and <i>Drift</i>. Choose your path, push your limits, and prove your skills behind the wheel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Time Trial</i> \u2013 Race against the clock and beat checkpoint challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Parkour</i> \u2013 Navigate wild stunt courses where your car must jump, land, and climb across urban obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Drift</i> \u2013 Rack up points by mastering corners and controlling your slide.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Capture System</strong><br>Speed zones across the city measure your velocity \u2014 go too fast, get caught, and earn bragging rights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Diamonds</strong><br>Hunt for hidden diamonds scattered across each map to unlock rewards and perfect your routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission-Based Gameplay</strong><br>Each mode features carefully crafted missions that increase in difficulty and demand true driving precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Urban Environment</strong><br>A sleek, colorful city filled with highways, rooftops, ramps, and tight turns \u2014 all optimized for smooth performance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect For Fans Of:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift and stunt-based driving games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style racing with bite-sized missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge runs and high-score chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, casual driving fun with replay value</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to own the streets?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc1 Street Drive Rush</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the streets in a high-speed, urban driving experience packed with challenge and variety.</strong><br>In <i>Street Drive Rush</i>, you\u2019ll take on the city in three distinct driving modes: <i>Time Trial, Parkour,</i> and <i>Drift</i>. Choose your path, push your limits, and prove your skills behind the wheel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Time Trial</i> \u2013 Race against the clock and beat checkpoint challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Parkour</i> \u2013 Navigate wild stunt courses where your car must jump, land, and climb across urban obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Drift</i> \u2013 Rack up points by mastering corners and controlling your slide.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Capture System</strong><br>Speed zones across the city measure your velocity \u2014 go too fast, get caught, and earn bragging rights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Diamonds</strong><br>Hunt for hidden diamonds scattered across each map to unlock rewards and perfect your routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission-Based Gameplay</strong><br>Each mode features carefully crafted missions that increase in difficulty and demand true driving precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Urban Environment</strong><br>A sleek, colorful city filled with highways, rooftops, ramps, and tight turns \u2014 all optimized for smooth performance.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Perfect For Fans Of:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift and stunt-based driving games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style racing with bite-sized missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge runs and high-score chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, casual driving fun with replay value</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to own the streets?</p>",
    "short_description": "Race through a stylized city in Time Trial, Parkour, and Drift modes. Master checkpoints, pull off stunts, collect diamonds, and trigger Speed Capture zones to earn big in this fast-paced urban driving challenge.",
